<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #39200.">fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3006794889" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39200" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/39200/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39200">#39200</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">If not read carefully, one may not realize that the placeholder for the alpha channel is <code class="notranslate">alpha</code> and not <code class="notranslate">a</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">The PR</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>sprinkles <code class="notranslate">alpha</code> keywords wherever possible</li>
<li>adds a whole example about manipulating the alpha channel using the <code class="notranslate">calc()</code> function</li>
<li>Increase the heights of some live samples to avoid vertical scrollbars</li>
</ul>]]></content>
